<title>NEW ZEALAND: HongkongBank NZ cuts floating mortgage rate.</title>
<headline>HongkongBank NZ cuts floating mortgage rate.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>HongkongBank said on Tuesday it would cut its New Zealand floating mortgage rate to 10.50 percent from 10.95 percent, effective immediately for new business and from November 11 for existing customers.</p>
</text>
